# Public build settings for the published site. Nothing secret belongs here.
#
# VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID is deliberately empty: the ID that used to be here
# belonged to a Google project that refuses this site, so visitors landed on a
# Google error page. With it empty, the Google button is simply hidden.
# Create your own (SETUP-GOOGLE.md) and publish with
#   IINVTY_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=<your id> npm run deploy:pages
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
